          </p>

          <p>
            1 kWh winner: EcoFlow for most households, Jackery for carriers. If the box will mostly live in the house for outages, the Delta 3 Plus's output and expansion path win. If it will spend most of its life in a car, an RV or a campsite, the Explorer 1000 v2's lighter case and simpler controls make it the nicer companion.
